    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects a solution that provides intelligent assistance to hospital staff, with capabilities such as information consultation, drafting, and dossier-handling assistance. a solution that provides intelligent assistance to hospital staff, with capabilities such as information consultation, drafting, and dossier-handling assistance must be designed as an assistance tool, with no clinical or medico-administrative decision automated without explicit validation by a qualified professional." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk143> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What AI components and innovation strategy do we propose for this tender response?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk144> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context at we, we propose leveraging we Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities to provide intelligent assistance to hospital staff. our Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities grounds answers in we own validated documents, ensuring that the solution is well-suited for healthcare applications where accuracy and reliability are paramount. we can design an AI-powered assistant that provides information consultation, drafting, and dossier-handling assistance, while ensuring that all clinical or medico-administrative decisions require explicit validation by a qualified professional. we solution will be based on we core approach of retrieval-augmented generation, which allows for hybrid retrieval, re-ranking, query reformulation, multi-document synthesis, structured extraction, and template-guided drafting. we innovation strategy involves an iterative approach, starting with corpus selection and curation with the client's experts, followed by retrieval tuning, prompt and template design per use case, and an evaluation loop to ensure that Our solution meets the client's requirements. we will also provide explainability features, such as source citations, retrieved passages, and retrieval trace, to ensure transparency and trust in we AI-powered assistant. we believe that we Sovereign European open-weight model, which is fully auditable and has strong grounding behavior, is well-suited for this application, given the client's requirements for data sovereignty and explainability. we model selection principle will prioritize performance, explainability, and sovereignty, and we will work closely with the client to determine the optimal trade-off between performance, explainability, and sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk145> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging we AI capabilities and innovation strategy, we can provide a solution that meets the client's expectations for intelligent assistance, while ensuring that all decisions are validated by qualified professionals and that the solution is designed with transparency, explainability, and data sovereignty in mind." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message13> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk146> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client wishes to limit the environmental footprint of The client information systems, expecting a solution that contributes to reducing energy consumption and relies on low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we ensure we proposed solution meets these sustainability requirements, and what trade-offs are involved?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk148> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA, has capabilities that align with The client sustainability requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk149> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our company, Faber IA have green hosting partners, such as OuraneCloud in the EU, which offers sovereign hosting, renewable energy, a power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.2, and heat reuse." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must support medical coding (PMSI / ICD-10) for activity reporting (T2A)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk150> a prov:Entity ;
